    "body": "That's a bug in Chrome and Safari. Note that the normative requirements are lower:\r\n\r\n> On setting, strings must be parsed with this canvas element and the color assigned, and CanvasGradient and CanvasPattern objects must be assigned themselves. If parsing the value results in failure, then it must be ignored, and the attribute must retain its previous value.\r\n\r\nwhereby \"parsed\" is a reference to a very clear algorithm.\r\n\r\nI think what remains here is additional test coverage and browser bugs...",
